  "releaseNotes": "Discover.ConnectAsync's in-flight connect coalescing and GetOrConnectSharedAsync's shared-instance reuse are keyed by host/port only, which could silently join/reuse a connection built from a materially different DeviceConfiguration (different credentials, timeout, or connection options) for the same host/port. Both now perform an internal, field-by-field configuration equivalence check before joining an in-flight connect or reusing a cached shared instance; a mismatch falls through to an independent connect instead of throwing or silently sharing. No public API or equality contract changes.",
